    "lyrics": "[Intro]\n(Deep pulsing 808 sub-bass, distant city ambience, haunting synth melody)\n(Female Vocal - Soft, intimate, slowly rising)\nOh-oh-oh...\nCan you hear the city fading?\nJust one more night...\nJust one more feeling...\nDon't let the lights go out.\n(Heavy sub-bass impact)\n\n[Verse 1]\n(Male Rap Vocal - Deep, confident, aggressive flow over bouncing 808)\nWristband on, and the door swings wide,\nCold air gone when I step inside.\nDJ cuts the horn, leaves a hole in the beat,\nThen the 808 slides right under my feet.\nGlass in my hand, but I'm locked on the sound,\nSnare hits sharp, got my head going down.\nNo phones out, no time to pretend,\nWe're here for the part that we can't replay again!\n\n(Fast double-time flow)\nBack of the room to the front of the stage,\nWhole crew locked in, we're on the same page.\nKick drum snaps, let the pressure climb,\nLeave that world outside for the rest of the night!\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n(Female Vocal - Emotional rising melody, airy layered harmonies)\nLet the world outside go quiet,\nLet the colors come alive...\nIf this moment lasts forever,\nI don't need another life!\n\n(Drums drop out, rising synth)\n(Female - Powerful held note)\nDon't let it faaaaaade!\n\n[Chorus / Drop]\n(MASSIVE 808 DROP, aggressive brass stabs, thunderous war drums)\n(Female Vocal - Huge soaring euphoric melody)\nFade the city, let the lights burn out!\n(Male Rap Callout)\nCUT THE OUTSIDE! LET THE SUBS COME IN!\n(Female Vocal)\nI can feel forever in the sound!\n(Male Rap Callout)\nONE MORE HIT! LET THE NIGHT BEGIN!\n\n(Female Vocal - Higher, more emotional)\nHold that feeling, don't you let it go!\n(Male Rap Callout)\nHOLD THAT DROP! LET THE LOW END ROLL!\n(Female Vocal)\nIf the world stops turning, we won't know!\n(Male Rap Callout)\nFADE THE CITY! LET THE WHOLE ROOM GO!\n\n[Post-Chorus]\n(Heavy bouncing 808 groove, rhythmic brass stabs)\n(Female Vocal - Catchy soaring repeated melody)\nOh-oh-oh, stay right here!\nOh-oh-oh, disappear!\nOh-oh-oh, don't let go!\n(Male Hype Shout)\nFADE THE CITY!\n(Massive bass impact)\n\n[Verse 2]\n(Male Rap Vocal - Fast, punchy, rhythmic flow)\nThree-seventeen, still the room won't settle,\nKick so clean, but the sub hits heavy.\nDJ throws a fake-out, everybody freezes,\nHalf a bar empty, then the low end releases.\nLeft side jumps when the brass comes back,\nRight side answers with a clap on the track.\nNo need for another word or a sign,\nOne sound hits and we're moving in time!\n\n(More aggressive flow)\nSharp snare, fast hats, bassline slide,\nFeet on the floor but my head's outside.\nNo rewind button on a night like this,\nSo I'm taking every second that the speakers give!\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n(Female Vocal - Rising emotional melody)\nLet the world outside go quiet,\nLet the colors come alive...\nIf this moment lasts forever,\nI don't need another life!\n\n(Accelerating snare roll, sudden silence)\n(Female - Whisper)\nDon't let it fade...\n\n[Chorus / Drop]\n(EXPLOSIVE DISTORTED 808 DROP, aggressive brass, pounding war drums)\n(Female Vocal - Powerful soaring melody)\nFade the city, let the lights burn out!\n(Male Rap Callout)\nCUT THE OUTSIDE! LET THE SUBS COME IN!\n(Female Vocal)\nI can feel forever in the sound!\n(Male Rap Callout)\nONE MORE HIT! LET THE NIGHT BEGIN!\n\n(Female Vocal - Higher soaring register)\nHold that feeling, don't you let it go!\n(Male Rap Callout)\nHOLD THAT DROP! LET THE LOW END ROLL!\n(Female Vocal)\nIf the world stops turning, we won't know!\n(Male Rap Callout)\nFADE THE CITY! LET THE WHOLE ROOM GO!\n\n[Bridge]\n(Complete beat cut, atmospheric synth pad, distant echoing female voice)\n(Female Vocal - Emotional intimate singing)\nThere was a world before this moment...\nThere'll be a world when morning comes...\nBut somewhere in these flashing colors...\nI found a place where I belong...\n\n(Female Vocal - Slowly rising, layered harmonies)\nOh-oh-oh...\nDon't let me go...\nOh-oh-oh...\nI wanna stay...\n\n(Male Vocal - Deep whisper, completely dry)\nNo countdown.\nNo warning.\nJust one heartbeat...\n\n(One-bar complete silence)\n\n(Male Vocal - Explosive shout)\nBRING THAT BASS BACK!\n\n[Final Drop]\n(ULTIMATE PEAK ENERGY, brutal distorted 808, screaming brass, full war drums, layered female choir)\n(Female Vocal - Maximum emotional soaring power)\nFADE THE CITY, LET THE LIGHTS BURN OUT!\n(Male Rap)\nNO WAY BACK! LET THE SUBS COME IN!\n(Female Vocal)\nI CAN FEEL FOREVER IN THE SOUND!\n(Male Rap)\nONE MORE NIGHT! LET IT ALL BEGIN!\n\n(Female Vocal - Highest sustained melody)\nHold that feeling, don't you let it go!\n(Male Rap)\nLET THE WHOLE DAMN LOW END ROLL!\n(Female Vocal)\nIf the world stops turning, we won't know!\n(Male Rap)\nFADE THE CITY! HERE WE GO!\n\n[Final Post-Chorus]\n(Female Vocal - Full layered crowd singalong)\nOh-oh-oh, stay right here!\nOh-oh-oh, disappear!\nOh-oh-oh, don't let go!\n(Male Shout)\nFADE THE CITY!\n\n[Outro]\n(808 slowly fades, intimate female echo)\n(Female Vocal)\nLet the city disappear...\nI'm still here...\n(Final deep sub-bass impact)",
