    "lyrics": "Hier ist der erweiterte Songtext mit zusätzlichen Strophen, einer Bridge und einem zweiten Break/Drop. Mit diesem Aufbau kommt das Lied bei Suno typischerweise auf etwa 3:15 bis 3:30 Minuten:\n\nSongtext: \"Midnight Shadows\" (Extended Version)\n[Intro]\n(Dark synth pad building up, distant pitch-shifted vocal)\nYeah...\nShadows in the dark, yeah.\nClock hits midnight, we don't stop, yeah.\n\n[Verse 1]\nBlinding lights, but I see straight through,\nWhispers in the dark, yeah I'm calling you.\nSpeeding through the city in a blacked-out ride,\nGot the bass so deep, nowhere to hide.\nEyes locked on me, moving in slow-mo,\nWe take control, ready for the show.\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n(Rhythm builds up, snare roll accelerating)\nStep in the dark, feel the beat go down,\nWe take over the whole damn town.\nCount down three, two, one, let's go—\nFeel the pressure, let it blow!\n\n[Drop]\n(Heavy Slap House Bass, punchy kick, bouncy rhythm)\nMidnight shadows, we own the night!\n(Bass slap)\nMidnight shadows, under the light!\nYeah, we own the night!\n(Bouncy synth drop melody)\n\n[Verse 2]\n(Pitch-shifted vocal, chilled tone)\nHeavy low-end, vibrating the floor,\nEvery time it hits, they just want more.\nGot the pulse in my veins, ice in my chest,\nNever gonna stop, no time to rest.\nSmoke in the air, shadows on the wall,\nWhen the bass drops down, we rise above it all.\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n(Snare roll accelerating)\nStep in the dark, feel the beat go down,\nWe take over the whole damn town.\nCount down three, two, one, let's go—\nFeel the pressure, let it blow!\n\n[Drop]\n(Maximum energy, deep Slap Bassline)\nMidnight shadows, we own the night!\n(Bass slap)\nMidnight shadows, under the light!\nYeah, we own the night!\n(Bouncy synth drop melody)\n\n[Bridge]\n(Drums stop, atmospheric pads, filtered vocal)\nLost in the rhythm, nowhere to run,\nChasing the darkness until the sun.\nFeel the heartbeat in the sub-bass frequency,\nNothing else matters, just you and me.\n(Snare roll starting slow, speeding up)\nHere it comes again...\nHold your breath...\nLet it hit!\n\n[Drop]\n(Final explosive Drop, layered synths & maximum punch)\nMidnight shadows, we own the night!\n(Bass slap)\nMidnight shadows, under the light!\nYeah, we own the night!\n(Bouncy synth drop melody)\n\n[Outro]\n(Bass fades out, echoing dark synth pad)\nShadows in the dark...\nUnder the light...\nMidnight shadows...\nYeah... fade to black.",
